  "adapterChanges": [
    "Removed TypeScript filesystem/base64 checkpoint store; ESKA owns format, quota, revision comparison and atomic publication.",
    "Explicit create and revision-bound save/remove prevent stale updates from recreating a closed draft.",
    "One bounded upload serializes independent drafts and coalesces rapid updates; unchanged owner/base are reused.",
    "Initialized recovery endpoint survives a failed metadata open and has process identity instead of sessionId/generation.",
    "Restart/disconnect waits for storage acknowledgements; stale process endpoints cannot address replacements.",
    "A reconnect retains prior acknowledged revisions and does not silently accept another window overwrite.",
    "Offline input stays in native editor, warns that checkpoint requires backend, and reconciles on reconnect.",
    "Clean closes made offline remove the same acknowledged record on reconnect; an unrelated dirty draft remains."
  ],
